{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10291210","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10291210","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1029121001:2":{"text":"세상에, 정말 믿을 수가 없네요. 우리 도라가... 추격자라는 사악한 조직에 빠졌다니요!","source_cn":"天哪，我简直不敢相信，我的朵拉竟然……竟然加入了追影者...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7B71AA68BB5303C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1029121002:1":{"text":"발렌 씨가 널 말렸으니 망정이지! 하마터면 사지 멀쩡한 널 못 볼뻔했잖니!","source_cn":"还好维伦先生及时拦住了你！不然的话，我一定就看不到完整...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18CA38989175B73B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1029121003:1":{"text":"너의 시신을 보며 눈물을 흘리고는 시신을 처리하러 온 사람이 와서 강제로 떼어낼 때까지 너의 차가운 손을 꼬옥 붙잡고 있었겠지...","source_cn":"到时候我只能对着你剩下的骸骨哭泣，只能紧紧攥着你冰冷的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F6BAAEDEB688A7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029121004:1":{"text":"오, 나의 가여운 도라가 사악한 조직에 속아 넘어가더니, 몬스터에게 생명까지 빼앗겼어...","source_cn":"哦，我可怜的朵拉，不仅被邪恶组织蒙骗，还被魔物夺去了性命……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF63E8B5CF73AAC55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029121005:1":{"text":"잠깐, 엄마, 저 아직 살아 있어요! 저 멀쩡하다구요, 손도 아직 따뜻해요... 엄마 울지 마세요!","source_cn":"等等，妈妈，我还在呢！还好好的呢，手都还是热乎的……妈...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79D793F9868CBD19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029121006:2":{"text":"도라, 네가 이런 일을 저지를 줄은 몰랐구나. 정말 실망이다!","source_cn":"朵拉，你竟然做出这种事，真令我失望！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C27079FDB72B08A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1029121007:1":{"text":"죄송해요, 아빠...","source_cn":"对不起，爸爸……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D797C6C48444424","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029121008:1":{"text":"추격자에 가입하려고 했던 일은 그렇다 쳐도, 이렇게 오랜 시간 동안 고작 테스트 하나 때문에 정식 멤버가 못 되었다니? 내 딸이 이렇게 못났을 리가 없어.","source_cn":"你想要加入追影者就算了，结果这么长时间竟然还只是个编外...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65BF548C371162A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1029121009:1":{"text":"잠깐만요. 무슨 오해가 있으신 것 같은데, 추격자는 나쁜 조직이에요...","source_cn":"等一下，你是不是误会了什么，追影者是个坏组织……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABDC8B30361B66D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1029121010:2":{"text":"좋은 조직이든, 나쁜 조직이든, 내 딸이 가지지 못한 건, 다른 아이도 가질 수 없어!","source_cn":"我才不管什么好组织坏组织，我女儿没有的东西，别人的孩子...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB50C70B2DCFD20D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1029121011:1":{"text":"도라야, 발렌 씨가 추격자를 완전히 없앨 수 있도록 어서 기지의 위치를 알려 드리렴!","source_cn":"快，朵拉，你快把那个追影者的基地告诉维伦先生，让他把这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADDDBBE2F2AB095E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1029121012:1":{"text":"제가 그 조직을 없애려는 건 맞는데, 그것 때문이 아니라...","source_cn":"我是要清除组织没错，但不是因为这个……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D99326D77033BB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1029121013:1":{"text":"알겠어요, 다들 그만하세요... 제가 발렌 아저씨와 함께 갈게요...","source_cn":"好了好了，你们都别吵了……我带维伦先生过去……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13F4D7FC78F25F86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:朵拉母亲":{"text":"도라의 어머니","source":"朵拉母亲","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:朵拉":{"text":"도라","source":"朵拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:朵拉父亲":{"text":"도라의 아버지","source":"朵拉父亲","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:维伦":{"text":"발렌","source":"维伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":4}}